 "notes": "Two parallel branches meet at f1: (1) alloy -> Schottky junction -> carrier separation; (2) alloy -> near-zero Delta G_H*. Optical gain (pr1) kept as a side branch into the conclusion. Audits: o3 (HRTEM marks separate Ag and Pd fringes, no alloy spacing) qualifies the alloy claim s4; o17 (TR-PL curves nearly coincide) qualifies pr2; L1 (barrier height never measured) qualifies s5; o12 (cycling loss ~18%, text_silent) qualifies the side claim f3. The DFT |Delta G_H*| order matches the experimental rate order exactly (o13 vs o10). Supplementary figures (S3-S13: EDS, reference XRD, survey XPS, loading series, used-catalyst XRD/XPS, d-band centres, TR-PL fits) are not in the packet. BET surface areas and Zn/In/S XPS invariance left out as non-argumentative.",
 "review": {
  "judge": "senior investigator",
