  "changes": [
   "pr1 split: visible-absorption gain (pr1, o8 + o18) and apparent Tauc-gap narrowing 2.53 -> 2.35 eV (new pr4, o9); o9 -> pr4 evidences replaces o9 -> pr1; pr4 supports pr1",
